  "interpretation": [
    "601453-2026 is a competition notice with explicit change reference to 417627-2026 (notice UUID f8381887-5b8c-4f29-8943-4c380faba9b2 version 01). Both rows have notice-version 1; version 1 alone is not proof of first publication. TED Search metadata moves the tender date/time from 2026-08-31 21:59:59Z to 2026-09-02 21:59:59Z (+48 hours). This is a source metadata change, not full legal amendment clearance or operative portal verification.",
    "609559-2026 is notice-version 2 in the API. It was previously directly inspected as an official HTML notice. Historical 17/20 means inspected official publication documents, not 17 first versions. Do not alter frozen cohort membership or promote metadata to XML/PDF inspection.",
    "612757-2026 and 615414-2026 expose participation request deadlines (not tender deadlines); all three formerly missing document IDs have independently retrieved official Search metadata, corroborating the dates in the 2026-10-31 external issue comment without verifying its XML bytes.",
    "Three result notices: 729884-2026 (Riksbank bank/financial data) clos-nw, 3 tenders; 742670-2026 (Zoom for Nordics) selec-w, 1 tender, framework maximum SEK 6m and approximate/re-estimated SEK 4m, no result-value-notice; 779072-2026 (Livsmedelsverket energy-drink project manager) selec-w, 1 tender, result-value-notice SEK 2,724,579. Result metadata and values are not paid cash or evidence of AgentMine demand. The other 17 procedures lack returned result metadata in this query, not necessarily no result.",
    "Zoom public directory displays disagree in semantics: Tilldelat labels SEK 6m as awarded value, Vunnet shows SEK 4m, Licitera/Adjudera omit contract amount. Official fields explain distinct ceiling vs approximate value; no realized spend or generic directory error prevalence inferred."
  ],
